# M3 取证（§12.1 的证据类型 ②）：
# 203 张 png + 6 份表都入库——A3.11 的回归基线就是 docs/acceptance/M3/A3.1-baselines.json
# 里那 176 个像素指纹，表不入库就没有基线可比。共 47 MB。
# 落盘开关，跑完就删，别入库：
docs/acceptance/M3/.render
# 嫌 44 MB 基线图太重的话，打开下面两行：清单和表照样入库，A3.11 仍然能跑
# （它比的是指纹不是文件），要看图重跑一次 make evidence 即可，字节完全一致。
#docs/acceptance/M3/*.png
#!docs/acceptance/M3/M3-*-zoom8-*.png

# Local AICoin base builds and raw Xcode diagnostics; selected screenshots stay reviewable.
DerivedData-codex*/
.xcbuild-device/
.xcbuild-codex/
docs/acceptance/AICoin-base/*.xcresult/
docs/acceptance/AICoin-base/*attachments/
docs/acceptance/AICoin-base/compatibility/**/*.xcresult/
docs/acceptance/AICoin-base/compatibility/**/*attachments/

DerivedData-chart-foundation*/
docs/acceptance/AICoin-base/foundation/*.xcresult/
docs/acceptance/AICoin-base/foundation/*attachments/

# Gateway bytecode generated by local backend tests.
Backend/kanpan-gateway/__pycache__/

# Raw simulator result bundles stay local; summaries and selected screenshots are tracked.
docs/acceptance/eye-colors/*.xcresult/
docs/acceptance/eye-colors/*attachments/

DerivedData-review-tests/
docs/acceptance/drawing-v2/*.xcresult/
